231 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 967 0 R/E(Hard-coding the mining influence function into the GNN's graph edge weights, rather than pure black-box learning or pure physics simulation \204 physics-constrained ML fusion, not seen applied to mine subsidence in the research reviewed.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

232 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 968 0 R/E<>/Pg 14 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

233 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 969 0 R/E(A three-tier sensing design where each tier is explicitly mapped to a distinct, named subsidence mechanism \(not "another way of sensing the same thing"\) \204 including a precise division of labour within Tier 2 itself \(resistivity as direct detector, moisture as interpretation key, not two equally-weighted signals\).)/Pg 14 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

234 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 970 0 R/E(Dual-mode physics engine matching India's real mining mix \204 Longwall \(PIM + Knothe\) and Bord-and-Pillar \(PHSR/CPHSR\), selected per deployment. Over 90\20595% of Indian underground coal production is Bord-and-Pillar; most comparable proposals implicitly target the minority \(longwall\) case.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

235 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 971 0 R/E(Physics-Driven Digital Twin, not a 3D visualization gimmick \204 Monitoring Mode \(continuous expected-vs-observed divergence\) and Planning Mode \(forward simulation of hypothetical future extraction\).)/Pg 14 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

236 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 972 0 R/E(Two independent, structurally dissimilar prediction engines \(a learned PI-STGNN and a physics-only Digital Twin\) combined through Risk Synthesis \204 deliberate redundancy so a blind spot in one can't silently take down the whole system.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

237 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 973 0 R/E(Synthetic pretraining via the Probability Integral Method as a direct engineering answer to real failure-data scarcity, rather than assuming abundant labelled data.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

238 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 974 0 R/E(Satellite InSAR as calibration, not decoration \204 real Sentinel-1 data used to calibrate physics parameters and cross-validate, honestly scoped around its 6\20512 day revisit limitation.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

239 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 975 0 R/E(Cloud-independent emergency alerting \204 when internet is down but cellular voice is up, a DTMF-authenticated call pathway can still trigger the siren mesh; the edge gateway can make and act on a local risk decision with zero cloud dependency at all.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

240 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 976 0 R/E(Radical honesty in every output \204 "Fuzzy Risk Index" not "probability," satellite displacement labeled precisely, mock positions labeled as mock \204 built to survive real technical and regulatory scrutiny, not just a demo.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

241 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 119 0 R/Pg 15 0 R/A[960 0 R 0]/K[0]>>
endobj

242 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 977 0 R/E(Goaf/void formation \204 the immediate cause: extracted coal leaves an underground cavity; the ground above eventually moves to fill that space.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

243 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 978 0 R/E(Overburden/roof caving \204 rock layers directly above the goaf collapsing into it, propagating the void's effect upward.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

244 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 979 0 R/E(Stress redistribution and fracturing \204 removing coal shifts load onto surrounding rock, which can fracture under the new stress pattern, opening pathways that didn't exist before. \(This is the mechanism Tier 2 specifically targets.\))/Pg 15 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

245 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 980 0 R/E(Delayed pillar failure \(bord-and-pillar specifically\) \204 pillars can weaken and fail years or decades after extraction, a distinct trigger/timeline from active longwall subsidence.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

246 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 981 0 R/E(Groundwater/aquifer disruption \204 mining can drain or disturb water-bearing rock layers; loss of pore-pressure support can cause ground compaction through a mechanism distinct from cavity collapse. \(Deliberately excluded from Tier 2's current scope \204 see Part 4.4.\))/Pg 15 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

247 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 982 0 R/E(Rainfall/water infiltration \204 not a root cause on its own, but an accelerant: water softens rock, adds weight, changes pore pressure.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

248 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 983 0 R/E(Time-dependent creep \204 some rock masses deform slowly under sustained stress even without a new trigger.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

249 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 984 0 R/E(Multi-seam interaction \204 subsidence from one seam's extraction mechanically influencing a separately-mined neighbouring seam.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

