297 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1015 0 R/E(Cost \204 a cellular SIM per node is far more expensive at scale than a handful of shared gateway units.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

298 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1016 0 R/E(Redundancy \204 with a mesh, neighbouring nodes route around a failed node; with direct-to-cloud, one node's radio failure just means that node goes dark with no recovery path.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

