endobj

324 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1032 0 R/E(Groundwater/aquifer sensing \(water-table, pore-pressure\) \204 targets a genuinely different mechanism family \(mechanism 5 in Part 1.5\) more central to large-scale groundwater extraction than to goaf-collapse-driven coal mine subsidence specifically.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

