326 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1034 0 R/E(Gas/pathway-migration sensing \204 grounded in soil-gas seepage research, with a dual-purpose tie to mandatory coal-mine methane safety monitoring.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

