336 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 128 0 R/E(Kalman filtering runs on every reading, on the node, before transmission \204 never a gate, never discards anything. Logging rate is a separate, independent concern \(dual-rate logging\), so filtering and data retention are never conflated.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

